dot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated November 8, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">The best time to list, from five years of Horry County deed records month by month, with the weeks from listing to closing.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The best time to sell a house in Myrtle Beach is late spring and early summer. Homes that closed in June sold for a middle price about 6 percent above homes that closed in February. About 38 percent of a year's home sales here are recorded in March through June.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">To close in those months, list a house in March and a condo in late January or February. This spring, a home had a buyer after about 6 to 7 weeks on the market. Closing took about 5 weeks more.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The month is worth a few percent of the price. <a href="#what-matters-more" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">The year you sell in and the price you ask</a> can matter more.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Have us pick your listing date</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Have us pick my date</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory);padding-top:2.5rem"><div class="wrap"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:0;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#when-homes-sell" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">When homes sell</a></li><li><a href="#when-to-list" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">When to list</a></li><li><a href="#condo-or-house" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Condo or house</a></li><li><a href="#winter" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Winter</a></li><li><a href="#hurricane-season" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Hurricane season</a></li><li><a href="#tourists-and-school" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Tourists and school</a></li><li><a href="#what-matters-more" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">What matters more</a></li><li><a href="#best-time-to-sell-faq" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Best time to sell FAQ</a></li></ul></nav></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="when-homes-sell"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="When homes sell">When do the most homes sell in Myrtle Beach?</h2><style>.c3ph-f{position:relative;margin:0;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ivory-2)}.c3ph-f img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;obje